"Gives this entity its own login page. Lowercase letters, digits, dashes and "
"underscores. Leave empty for no dedicated login page."

msgid "Hold Ctrl (or Cmd) to select several."
msgstr "Hold Ctrl (or Cmd) to select several."

msgid ""
"Hold Ctrl (or Cmd) to select several. Inactive and domain-bound providers "
"are never displayed on the login page even if selected."
